- album animals el pulpo, el búho, el grillo, el tlacuache and el lobo (5 of 50, 10%);
- the word la chamarra, given only by Abuelo at night (zone-abuelos.js:426 jacketAsk);
- Lola's firefly jar (zone-bosque.js:219);
- 6 of the 180 words in all.

In every zone run with 15-minute sessions, no night-only animal or word was met.
